# 忽略所有文件
*

# 放行 .gitignore 自身
!.gitignore

# 放行目录，否则子目录里的文件无法匹配
!*/

# 只保留代码、项目、解决方案和共享构建配置
!*.cs
!*.csproj
!*.sln
!*.props
!*.targets
!*.xaml
!*.resx
!*.razor
!*.config
!*.json
!*.xml
!*.md
!*.sh
!*.ps1
!*.cmd
!*.bat
!*.yml
!*.yaml
!*.editorconfig
!*.gitignore

# 排除编译产物、包、测试报告和 IDE 缓存
bin/
obj/
.vs/
.vscode/
.idea/
packages/
node_modules/
artifacts/
dist/
publish/
TestResults/
*.dll
*.exe
*.pdb
*.nupkg
*.snupkg
*.user
*.suo
*.userosscache
*.sln.docstates
*.userprefs
*.log
*.tmp